<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs Pkg 556 lbs black 87.75; 600-700 lbs 71.50-75.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 65.00-67.50; 700-800 lbs 61.50-66.25. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
